==Trivia==

===Origin===
{{main|Pokémon world in relation to the real world#In the movies|Pokémon world in relation to the real world → In the movies}}
Allearth Forest is modeled after {{wp|Flowerpot Island}}<ref name="Canada">Location Scouting Report on the Pokémon movie website ([https://web.archive.org/web/20140625080318/http://www.pokemon-movie.jp/locahan_report/ archived]) (Japanese) ([https://dogasu.bulbagarden.net/movies/2014_xy_cocoon_destruction_diancie/xy_cocoon_destruction_diancie_location_scouting.html English translation by Dogasu])</ref> in {{wp|Georgian Bay}}, located in the {{wp|Canada|Canadian}} province of {{wp|Ontario}}. The waterfalls are based on the {{wp|Niagara Falls}}<ref name="Canada" />, located by the international borders between Ontario and the state of {{wp|New York (state)|New York}} in the United States.

